       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           I D E N T I F I C A T I O N   D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM NAME
      ******************************************************************
       PROGRAM-ID. SWB4805.
      ******************************************************************
      *                                                                *
      *                      - MENSAGENS SWIFT -                       *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
      * CARREGAMENTO DE OPERAÇÕES                                      *
      ******************************************************************
      *           L O G     D E     A L T E R A C O E S                *
      ******************************************************************
      *  INICIO  * AUTOR  * FIM    *  C O M E N T A R I O S            *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           E N V I R O N M E N T         D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                     CONFIGURATION SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
      ******************************************************************
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                      INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       FILE-CONTROL.
      ******************************************************************
       DATA DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                   D A T A   D I V I S I O N                    *
      ******************************************************************
       FILE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                          FILE SECTION                          *
      ******************************************************************
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                    WORKING STORAGE SECTION                     *
      ******************************************************************
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
                                               'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE'.
      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM CONTROL
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWB4805'.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * TABELAS
      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5606  END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD6302  END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCDPARAM END-EXEC.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * APIS
      ******************************************************************
           COPY AQCK0001.
           COPY AQCW0109.
           COPY VIAW0011.

      ******************************************************************
      * APIS
      ******************************************************************
           COPY SXCL0002.
           COPY SXCL0445.
           COPY ETCL1000.

      ******************************************************************
      * CONSTANTES
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-OPE-VISA             PIC  X(06) VALUE 'OPE_VISA'.
           05 CON-OPR-VISA             PIC  X(06) VALUE 'OPR-VISA'.
           05 CON-OPE-WU               PIC  X(06) VALUE 'OPE-WU'.
           05 CON-OPE-WU-COM           PIC  X(06) VALUE 'OPE-WU-COM'.
           05 CON-OPR-WU               PIC  X(06) VALUE 'OPR-WU'.
           05 CON-DIAS                 PIC  X(01) VALUE 'D'.
           05 CON-PD                   PIC  X(02) VALUE 'PD'.
           05 CON-P                    PIC  X(02) VALUE 'P'.
           05 CON-O00                  PIC  X(03) VALUE 'O00'.
           05 CON-ALFA                 PIC  X(01) VALUE 'A'.
           05 CON-SWVT5606             PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT5606'.
           05 CON-OEORDPAG             PIC  X(08) VALUE 'OEORDPAG'.
           05 CON-ANULADA              PIC  X(01) VALUE 'A'.
           05 CON-TRATADA              PIC  X(01) VALUE 'T'.

      ******************************************************************
      * VARIAVEIS
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-DT-D-PRC                  PIC  9(08).
           05 WS-DT-D-ANT                  PIC  9(08).
      *    05 WS-DATA                      PIC  9(08).
      *    05 WS-DATA-R REDEFINES WS-DATA.
      *       10 WS-NANO                   PIC  9(04).
      *       10 WS-NMES                   PIC  9(02).
      *       10 WS-NDIA                   PIC  9(02).
           05 WS-PRAZO.
              10 WS-TIPO                   PIC  X(01).
              10 WS-DIAS                   PIC  9(02).
      *    05 WS-TOPREC                    PIC S9(03) COMP-3.
      *    05 WS-TEXREC                    PIC S9(03) COMP-3.
      *    05 WS-TOPPEND                   PIC S9(03) COMP-3.
      *    05 WS-TEXPEND                   PIC S9(03) COMP-3.
           05 WS-OEOPDATL-INI              PIC S9(08) COMP-3.
           05 WS-OEOPDATL-INI-A            PIC  X(08).
           05 WS-OEOPDATL-INI-N            PIC  9(08).
      *    05 WS-TEXEC                     PIC  9(08).

      ******************************************************************
      * SWITCHES
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-SWITCHES.
           05 WS-CURSOR-STATE         PIC S9(03) COMP-3
                                                  VALUE +0.
              88 WS-CURSOR-OK                     VALUE +0.
              88 WS-CURSOR-END                    VALUE -1.
           05 SW-TEXEC                PIC  X(01)  VALUE 'D'.
              88 SW-RECUP                         VALUE 'R'.
              88 SW-DIA                           VALUE 'D'.
           05 WS-STATUS-SWPARAM       PIC S9(03)  VALUE +0.
              88 WS-SWPARAM-OK                    VALUE +0.
              88 WS-SWPARAM-NOTFND                VALUE +100.

      ******************************************************************
      * COPYS
      ******************************************************************
           COPY VIAW0030.
           COPY VIAL0015.

      *    COPY AQCW0009.
           COPY AQCW0011.

           COPY SWCK0001.
           COPY SWCK0002.

      ******************************************************************
      * DB2
      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE ETCDORDP END-EXEC.

           EXEC SQL
                DECLARE CRS_OEORDPAG CURSOR FOR
                 SELECT OEOPNOPR
                      , OEOPPROC
                      , OEOPTMOV
                      , OEOPDATL
                      , OEOPUSER
                      , OEOPETRB
                      , OEOPBALM
                      , OEOPBAL
                      , OEOPNCLI
                      , OEOPCNTO
                      , OEOPBALC
                      , OEOPCCB
                      , OEOPMOEC
                      , OEOPSITU
                      , OEOPDTVC
                      , OEOPDTVCOR
                      , OEOPDTLO
                      , OEOPCEST
                      , OEOPROPR
                      , OEOPRCLI
                      , OEOPDGAS
                      , OEOPCNTA
                      , OEOPVLR
                      , OEOPMOED
                      , OEOPDMOV
                      , OEOPCBAN
                      , OEOPSPAI
                      , OEOPMSGO
                   FROM OEORDPAG
                  WHERE OEOPDATL >= :WS-OEOPDATL-INI
                    AND OEOPTOPR NOT IN ( :CON-OPE-WU
                                        , :CON-OPE-WU-COM
                                        , :CON-OPR-WU
                                        , :CON-OPE-VISA
                                        , :CON-OPR-VISA)
                    AND OEOPSITU = :CON-TRATADA
                    ORDER BY OEOPPROC, OEOPNOPR
                    WITH UR
           END-EXEC.

      ******************************************************************
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
                                               'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE'.

      ******************************************************************
       LINKAGE SECTION.
           COPY AQCW0009.

      ******************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING AQCW0009-DATA.

      ******************************************************************
      *              P R O C E D U R E   D I V I S I O N               *
      ******************************************************************
       0000-MAINLINE.
           MOVE '0000-MAINLINE    '        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
                 THRU 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 3000-FIM-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3000-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

       0000-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           GOBACK.

      ******************************************************************
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           INITIALIZE WS-VARIAVEIS.

           SET AQCW0009-RCODE-OK           TO TRUE.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM AQCP0100-REG-INICIO
                 THRU AQCP0100-REG-INICIO-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM AQCP0100-OBT-DADOS-ARQ
                 THRU AQCP0100-OBT-DADOS-ARQ-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE AQCW0100-AT-DTOP           TO WS-DT-D-PRC.

      *    IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
      *       PERFORM 1100-OBTEM-DIA-ANTERIOR
      *          THRU 1100-OBTEM-DIA-ANTERIOR-EXIT
      *    END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 1200-OBTEM-DT-PARAM
                 THRU 1200-OBTEM-DT-PARAM-EXIT
           END-IF.

       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
      *1100-OBTEM-DIA-ANTERIOR.
      ******************************************************************
      *    MOVE '1100-OBTEM-DIA-ANTERIOR'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *    IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
      *       PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
      *          THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
      *    END-IF.
      *
      *    INITIALIZE ETCL1000-AREA-COMUNICACAO.
      *
      *    SET  ETCL1000-SUBTRAI-PRAZO     TO TRUE.
      *    MOVE AQCW0100-AT-DTOP           TO WS-DT-D-PRC.
      *    MOVE WS-DT-D-PRC                TO ETCL1000-DAT-INPUT1.
      *    MOVE CON-DIAS                   TO WS-TIPO.
      *    MOVE 01                         TO WS-DIAS.
      *    MOVE WS-PRAZO                   TO ETCL1000-COD-PRZ.
      *
      *    PERFORM ETCP1000-ROTINA-DATAS
      *       THRU ETCP1000-EXIT.
      *
      *    IF CALCULO-EFECTUADO
      *       MOVE ETCL1000-DAT-RES        TO WS-DT-D-PRC
      *    ELSE
      *       SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR      TO TRUE
      *       MOVE WS-PROGNAME             TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
      *       MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID      TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
      *       MOVE 'ETR01000'              TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
      *       MOVE ZEROES                  TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
      *       MOVE SPACES                  TO VIAW0030-ACCESS-KEY
      *       MOVE 'ERRO NO CÁLCULO DA DATA'
      *                                    TO VIAW0030-DESC1
      *       PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
      *          THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
      *    END-IF.
      *
      *1100-OBTEM-DIA-ANTERIOR-EXIT.
      *    EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       1200-OBTEM-DT-PARAM.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '1200-OBTEM-DT-PARAM'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 1210-OBTEM-EXECUCAO
              THRU 1210-OBTEM-EXECUCAO-EXIT.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
             IF SW-RECUP
               PERFORM 1220-OBTEM-DATA
                  THRU 1220-OBTEM-DATA-EXIT
             ELSE
               MOVE WS-DT-D-ANT            TO WS-OEOPDATL-INI
             END-IF
           END-IF.

       1200-OBTEM-DT-PARAM-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       1210-OBTEM-EXECUCAO.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '1210-OBTEM-EXECUCAO'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE 'SW'                       TO SWPARAM-PRCODPAR.
           MOVE 'EXESWB4805'               TO SWPARAM-PRPARAM.

           EXEC SQL
               SELECT PRVALALF
                    , PRVALDAT
                 INTO :SWPARAM-PRVALALF
                    , :SWPARAM-PRVALDAT
                 FROM SWPARAM
                WHERE PRCODPAR = :SWPARAM-PRCODPAR
                  AND PRPARAM  = :SWPARAM-PRPARAM
                WITH UR
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE SQLCODE                    TO WS-STATUS-SWPARAM.

           IF WS-SWPARAM-OK
              MOVE SWPARAM-PRVALALF        TO SW-TEXEC
              MOVE SWPARAM-PRVALDAT        TO WS-DT-D-ANT
           ELSE
              IF WS-SWPARAM-NOTFND
                 MOVE SPACES               TO SW-TEXEC
                 MOVE 10101                TO WS-DT-D-ANT
              ELSE
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL    TO TRUE
                SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR    TO TRUE
                MOVE WS-PROGNAME           TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID    TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME   TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE      TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                MOVE 'ERRO ACESSO SWPARAM' TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       1210-OBTEM-EXECUCAO-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       1220-OBTEM-DATA.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '1220-OBTEM-DATA'          TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE 'SW'                       TO SWPARAM-PRCODPAR.
           MOVE 'DINSWB4805'               TO SWPARAM-PRPARAM.

           EXEC SQL
               SELECT PRVALALF
                 INTO :SWPARAM-PRVALALF
                 FROM SWPARAM
                WHERE PRCODPAR = :SWPARAM-PRCODPAR
                  AND PRPARAM  = :SWPARAM-PRPARAM
                WITH UR
           END-EXEC

           MOVE SQLCODE                    TO WS-STATUS-SWPARAM

           IF WS-SWPARAM-OK
              MOVE SWPARAM-PRVALALF        TO WS-OEOPDATL-INI-A
              MOVE WS-OEOPDATL-INI-A       TO WS-OEOPDATL-INI-N
              MOVE WS-OEOPDATL-INI-N       TO WS-OEOPDATL-INI
           ELSE
              IF WS-SWPARAM-NOTFND
                 MOVE WS-DT-D-ANT          TO WS-OEOPDATL-INI
              ELSE
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL    TO TRUE
                SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR    TO TRUE
                MOVE WS-PROGNAME           TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID    TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME   TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE      TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                MOVE 'ERRO ACESSO SWPARAM' TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       1220-OBTEM-DATA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.

           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 2100-OPEN-CURSOR
              THRU 2100-OPEN-CURSOR-EXIT.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2200-FETCH-CURSOR
                 THRU 2200-FETCH-CURSOR-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2300-PROCESSA-CURSOR
                 THRU 2300-PROCESSA-CURSOR-EXIT
                UNTIL WS-CURSOR-END
                   OR NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 2400-CLOSE-CURSOR
              THRU 2400-CLOSE-CURSOR-EXIT.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS AND SW-DIA
              PERFORM 2500-ACTUALIZA-DTEXEC
                 THRU 2500-ACTUALIZA-DTEXEC-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2100-OPEN-CURSOR.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2100-OPEN-CURSOR'         TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           SET WS-CURSOR-OK                TO TRUE.

           MOVE CON-OEORDPAG               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
      **R  MOVE WS-DT-D-ANT                TO WS-OEOPDATL-INI.

           EXEC SQL
              OPEN CRS_OEORDPAG
           END-EXEC.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                 SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'ERRO OPEN DO CURSOR'
                                           TO VIAW0030-DESC1
              PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                 THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2100-OPEN-CURSOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2200-FETCH-CURSOR.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2200-FETCH-CURSOR'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE CON-OEORDPAG               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           EXEC SQL
              FETCH CRS_OEORDPAG
               INTO :OEORDPAG-OEOPNOPR
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPPROC
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPTMOV
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPDATL
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPUSER
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPETRB
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPBALM
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPBAL
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPNCLI
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPCNTO
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPBALC
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPCCB
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPMOEC
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPSITU
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPDTVC
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPDTVCOR
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPDTLO
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPCEST
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPROPR
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPRCLI
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPDGAS
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPCNTA
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPVLR
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPMOED
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPDMOV
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPCBAN
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPSPAI
                  , :OEORDPAG-OEOPMSGO
           END-EXEC.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                 SET WS-CURSOR-END         TO TRUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                 SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'ERRO NA LEITURA DO CURSOR'
                                           TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2200-FETCH-CURSOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2300-PROCESSA-CURSOR.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2300-PROCESSA-CURSOR'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.

           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 2310-CONSTROI-SAIDA
              THRU 2310-CONSTROI-SAIDA-EXIT.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2320-VERIF-INSERT
                 THRU 2320-VERIF-INSERT-EXIT
      **R     PERFORM 2320-INSERT-LINHA
      **R        THRU 2320-INSERT-LINHA-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2200-FETCH-CURSOR
                 THRU 2200-FETCH-CURSOR-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2300-PROCESSA-CURSOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2310-CONSTROI-SAIDA.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2310-CONSTROI-SAIDA'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SPACES                     TO DCLSWCD5606.
           INITIALIZE DCLSWCD5606 REPLACING NUMERIC BY ZEROES.

           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPNOPR          TO SWCD5606-NOPR.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPPROC          TO SWCD5606-CORIGEM.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPTMOV          TO SWCD5606-CTMOV.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPDATL          TO SWCD5606-DATL.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPUSER          TO SWCD5606-CUSER.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPETRB          TO SWCD5606-CETRB.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPBALM          TO SWCD5606-CBALM.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPBAL           TO SWCD5606-CBAL.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPNCLI          TO SWCD5606-NCLI.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPCNTO          TO SWCD5606-CNTO.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPBALC          TO SWCD5606-CBALC.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPCCB           TO SWCD5606-CCB.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPMOEC          TO SWCD5606-CMOEC.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPSITU          TO SWCD5606-CSITU.

           IF OEORDPAG-OEOPPROC = SWCK0002-TIPO-OPE
               IF OEORDPAG-OEOPDTVCOR NOT EQUAL ZEROES
                  MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPDTVCOR  TO SWCD5606-DTVC
               ELSE
                  IF OEORDPAG-OEOPDTLO NOT EQUAL ZEROES
                    MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPDTLO  TO SWCD5606-DTVC
                  ELSE
                    MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPDTVC  TO SWCD5606-DTVC
                  END-IF
               END-IF
           ELSE
               IF OEORDPAG-OEOPDTVC NOT EQUAL ZEROES
                 MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPDTVC     TO SWCD5606-DTVC
               ELSE
                 IF OEORDPAG-OEOPDTVCOR NOT EQUAL ZEROES
                   MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPDTVCOR TO SWCD5606-DTVC
                 ELSE
                   MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPDTLO   TO SWCD5606-DTVC
                 END-IF
               END-IF
           END-IF.

           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPCEST          TO SWCD5606-CEST.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPROPR          TO SWCD5606-CROPR.

           IF OEORDPAG-OEOPMSGO(209:1) EQUAL '#'
              MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPRCLI       TO SWCD5606-CRCLI
              MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPMSGO(210:1) TO SWCD5606-CRCLI(16:1)
           ELSE
              MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPRCLI       TO SWCD5606-CRCLI
           END-IF.

           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPDGAS          TO SWCD5606-CDGAS.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPCNTA          TO SWCD5606-CNTA.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPVLR           TO SWCD5606-MVLR.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPMOED          TO SWCD5606-CMOED.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPDMOV          TO SWCD5606-CDMOV.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPCBAN          TO SWCD5606-CBAN.
           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPSPAI          TO SWCD5606-CSPAI.
           MOVE CON-PD                     TO SWCD5606-CCODEST.
           MOVE CON-P                      TO SWCD5606-CTIPREC.
           MOVE CON-O00                    TO SWCD5606-CNIVREC.
           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWCD5606-CUSERID.

       2310-CONSTROI-SAIDA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2320-VERIF-INSERT.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2320-VERIF-INSERT'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.

           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE OEORDPAG-OEOPNOPR          TO SWCD5606-NOPR

           EXEC SQL
               SELECT NOPR
                 INTO :SWCD5606-NOPR
                 FROM SWVT5606
                WHERE NOPR     = :SWCD5606-NOPR
                WITH UR
           END-EXEC

           MOVE CON-SWVT5606               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                PERFORM 2321-INSERT-LINHA
                   THRU 2321-INSERT-LINHA-EXIT
      **R       CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                 SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'ERRO DE ESCRITA NA TABELA'
                                           TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2320-VERIF-INSERT-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2321-INSERT-LINHA.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2321-INSERT-LINHA'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.

           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
               INSERT
                 INTO SWVT5606
                      ( NOPR
                      , CROPR
                      , CORIGEM
                      , CTMOV
                      , DTVC
                      , DATL
                      , CUSER
                      , CETRB
                      , CBALM
                      , CBAL
                      , NCLI
                      , CNTO
                      , CBALC
                      , CCB
                      , CMOEC
                      , CSITU
                      , CEST
                      , CRCLI
                      , CDGAS
                      , CNTA
                      , MVLR
                      , CMOED
                      , CDMOV
                      , CBAN
                      , CSPAI
                      , NOPRREC
                      , CCODEST
                      , CREFREC
                      , DATREC
                      , CTIPREC
                      , GDESC
                      , MOTIVO
                      , OBSER
                      , CBYPASS
                      , CSENDREC
                      , MVLRREC
                      , CMOEDREC
                      , DTVCREC
                      , CNIVREC
                      , CUSERID
                      , HTIMEST)
               VALUES (
                      :SWCD5606-NOPR
                    , :SWCD5606-CROPR
                    , :SWCD5606-CORIGEM
                    , :SWCD5606-CTMOV
                    , :SWCD5606-DTVC
                    , :SWCD5606-DATL
                    , :SWCD5606-CUSER
                    , :SWCD5606-CETRB
                    , :SWCD5606-CBALM
                    , :SWCD5606-CBAL
                    , :SWCD5606-NCLI
                    , :SWCD5606-CNTO
                    , :SWCD5606-CBALC
                    , :SWCD5606-CCB
                    , :SWCD5606-CMOEC
                    , :SWCD5606-CSITU
                    , :SWCD5606-CEST
                    , :SWCD5606-CRCLI
                    , :SWCD5606-CDGAS
                    , :SWCD5606-CNTA
                    , :SWCD5606-MVLR
                    , :SWCD5606-CMOED
                    , :SWCD5606-CDMOV
                    , :SWCD5606-CBAN
                    , :SWCD5606-CSPAI
                    , :SWCD5606-NOPRREC
                    , :SWCD5606-CCODEST
                    , :SWCD5606-CREFREC
                    , :SWCD5606-DATREC
                    , :SWCD5606-CTIPREC
                    , :SWCD5606-GDESC
                    , :SWCD5606-MOTIVO
                    , :SWCD5606-OBSER
                    , :SWCD5606-CBYPASS
                    , :SWCD5606-CSENDREC
                    , :SWCD5606-MVLRREC
                    , :SWCD5606-CMOEDREC
                    , :SWCD5606-DTVCREC
                    , :SWCD5606-CNIVREC
                    , :SWCD5606-CUSERID
                    , CURRENT TIMESTAMP
               )
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT5606               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
      *          MOVE SWCD5606-CBAN      TO SWCD6302-CBAN
      *          MOVE SWCD5606-CSPAI     TO SWCD6302-CSPAI
      *          MOVE SWCD5606-DTVC      TO WS-DATA
      *          MOVE WS-NANO            TO SWCD6302-NANO
      *          MOVE  0                 TO WS-TOPREC
      *          MOVE  0                 TO WS-TEXREC
      *          MOVE +1                 TO WS-TOPPEND
      *          MOVE  0                 TO WS-TEXPEND
      *          PERFORM 2500-CALL-SWM5415
      *             THRU 2500-CALL-SWM5415-EXIT
              WHEN AQCW0011-DUPREC
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                 SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'ERRO DE ESCRITA NA TABELA'
                                           TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2321-INSERT-LINHA-EXIT.
            EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2400-CLOSE-CURSOR.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2400-CLOSE-CURSOR'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE CON-OEORDPAG               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.

           EXEC SQL
              CLOSE CRS_OEORDPAG
           END-EXEC.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                 SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'ERRO NO FECHO DO CURSOR'
                                           TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.

       2400-CLOSE-CURSOR-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       2500-ACTUALIZA-DTEXEC.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '2500-ACTUALIZA-DTEXEC'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE 'SW'                       TO SWPARAM-PRCODPAR.
           MOVE 'EXESWB4805'               TO SWPARAM-PRPARAM.

           MOVE WS-DT-D-PRC                TO SWPARAM-PRVALDAT.
           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWPARAM-CUSERID.

           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWPARAM
                 SET PRVALDAT = :SWPARAM-PRVALDAT
                   , CUSERID  = :SWPARAM-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEEST = CURRENT TIMESTAMP
               WHERE PRCODPAR = :SWPARAM-PRCODPAR
                 AND PRPARAM  = :SWPARAM-PRPARAM
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE SQLCODE                    TO WS-STATUS-SWPARAM.

           IF WS-SWPARAM-OK
              CONTINUE
           ELSE
              SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL      TO TRUE
              SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR      TO TRUE
              MOVE WS-PROGNAME             TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
              MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID      TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
              MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME     TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
              MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE        TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
              MOVE 'ERRO UPD SWPARAM'      TO VIAW0030-DESC1
              PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                 THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2500-ACTUALIZA-DTEXEC-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
      *2500-CALL-SWM5415.
      ******************************************************************
      *    MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWCD6302-CUSERID.
      *
      *    EXEC SQL
      *        UPDATE SWVT6302
      *           SET TOPREC   = TOPREC  + :WS-TOPREC
      *             , TEXREC   = TEXREC  + :WS-TEXREC
      *             , TOPPEND  = TOPPEND + :WS-TOPPEND
      *             , TEXPEND  = TEXPEND + :WS-TEXPEND
      *             , CUSERID  = :SWCD6302-CUSERID
      *             , HTIMEEST = CURRENT TIMESTAMP
      *         WHERE CBAN     = :SWCD6302-CBAN
      *           AND CSPAI    = :SWCD6302-CSPAI
      *           AND NANO     = :SWCD6302-NANO
      *    END-EXEC.
      *
      *    PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
      *       THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
      *     EVALUATE TRUE
      *        WHEN AQCW0011-OK
      *             CONTINUE
      *        WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
      *             PERFORM 2550-INSERT-SWT63
      *                THRU 2550-INSERT-SWT63-EXIT
      *        WHEN OTHER
      *           SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
      *           SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
      *           MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
      *           MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
      *           MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
      *           MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
      *           MOVE 'ERRO NA ACTUALIZACAO'
      *                                     TO VIAW0030-DESC1
      *           MOVE 'DA TABELA'          TO VIAW0030-DESC1
      *           PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
      *              THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
      *    END-EVALUATE.
      *
      *2500-CALL-SWM5415-EXIT.
      *    EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
      *2550-INSERT-SWT63.
      ******************************************************************
      *
      *    IF WS-TOPREC < ZEROS
      *       MOVE ZEROS                   TO SWCD6302-TOPREC
      *    ELSE
      *       MOVE WS-TOPREC               TO SWCD6302-TOPREC
      *    END-IF.
      *    IF WS-TEXREC < ZEROS
      *       MOVE ZEROS                   TO SWCD6302-TEXREC
      *    ELSE
      *       MOVE WS-TEXREC               TO SWCD6302-TEXREC
      *    END-IF.
      *    IF WS-TOPPEND < ZEROS
      *       MOVE ZEROS                   TO SWCD6302-TOPPEND
      *    ELSE
      *       MOVE WS-TOPPEND              TO SWCD6302-TOPPEND
      *    END-IF.
      *    IF WS-TEXPEND < ZEROS
      *       MOVE ZEROS                   TO SWCD6302-TEXPEND
      *    ELSE
      *       MOVE WS-TEXPEND              TO SWCD6302-TEXPEND
      *    END-IF.
      *
      *    EXEC SQL
      *       INSERT INTO SWVT6302
      *             ( CBAN, CSPAI, TOPREC, TEXREC
      *             , TOPPEND, TEXPEND, CUSERID, HTIMEEST, NANO)
      *         VALUES
      *           ( :SWCD6302-CBAN
      *           , :SWCD6302-CSPAI
      *           , :SWCD6302-TOPREC
      *           , :SWCD6302-TEXREC
      *           , :SWCD6302-TOPPEND
      *           , :SWCD6302-TEXPEND
      *           , :SWCD6302-CUSERID
      *           , CURRENT TIMESTAMP
      *           , :SWCD6302-NANO )
      *    END-EXEC
      *
      *    PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
      *       THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
      *    EVALUATE TRUE
      *       WHEN AQCW0011-OK
      *            CONTINUE
      *       WHEN OTHER
      *          SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
      *          SET  VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
      *          MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
      *          MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
      *          MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
      *          MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
      *          MOVE 'ERRO NA INSERCAO '
      *                                    TO VIAW0030-DESC1
      *          MOVE 'DA TABELA'          TO VIAW0030-DESC1
      *          PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
      *             THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
      *    END-EVALUATE.
      *
      *2550-INSERT-SWT63-EXIT.
      *    EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
       3000-FIM-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '3000-FIM-PROGRAMA'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF VIAL0015-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM AQCP0100-REG-FIM
                 THRU AQCP0100-REG-FIM-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM AQCP0002-TRATA-SYNCPOINT
              THRU AQCP0002-TRATA-SYNCPOINT-EXIT.

       3000-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE AQCP0002 END-EXEC.
      ******************************************************************
           COPY VIAP0011.
           COPY VIAP0015.
           COPY VIAP0030.
           COPY AQCP0011.
           COPY AQCP0109.
           COPY ETCP1000.
